  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "49",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 49"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "49",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jacob called unto his sons, and said, Gather yourselves together, that I may tell you",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.49.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.49.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "which shall befall you in the last days.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gather yourselves together, and hear, ye sons of Jacob; and hearken unto Israel your father.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Reuben, thou",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "art",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.49.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.49.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my firstborn, my might, and the beginning of my strength, the excellency of dignity, and the excellency of power:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unstable as water, thou shalt not excel; because thou wentest up to thy father's bed; then defiledst thou",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it:",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.49.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.49.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he went up to my couch.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Simeon and Levi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.49.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.49.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "brethren; instruments of cruelty",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are in",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.49.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.49.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "their habitations.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O my soul, come not thou into their secret; unto their assembly, mine honour, be not thou united: for in their anger they slew a man, and in their selfwill they digged down a wall.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cursed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.49.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.49.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "their anger, for",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.49.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.49.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fierce; and their wrath, for it was cruel: I will divide them in Jacob, and scatter them in Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Judah, thou",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "art he",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.49.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.49.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "whom thy brethren shall praise: thy hand",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.49.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.49.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the neck of thine enemies; thy father's children shall bow down before thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Judah",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.49.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.49.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a lion's whelp: from the prey, my son, thou art gone up: he stooped down, he couched as a lion, and as an old lion; who shall rouse him up?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sceptre shall not depart from Judah, nor a lawgiver from between his feet, until Shiloh come; and unto him",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.49.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.49.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the gathering of the people",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.49.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.49.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Binding his foal unto the vine, and his ass's colt unto the choice vine; he washed his garments in wine, and his clothes in the blood of grapes:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His eyes",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.49.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.49.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "red with wine, and his teeth white with milk.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Zebulun shall dwell at the haven of the sea; and he",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.49.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.49.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for an haven of ships; and his border",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.49.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.49.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "unto Zidon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Issachar",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.49.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.49.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a strong ass couching down between two burdens:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he saw that rest",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.49.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.49.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "good, and the land that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.49.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.49.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pleasant; and bowed his shoulder to bear, and became a servant unto tribute.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Dan shall judge his people, as one of the tribes of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dan shall be a serpent by the way, an adder in the path, that biteth the horse heels, so that his rider shall fall backward.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have waited for thy salvation, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
